PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadYoureHereWithYourPokemon:
	.string "DAD: Hm? {PLAYER}?\n"
	.string "Don't stand in front of the TV!\p"
	.string "I'm right at the part where the\n"
	.string "masked guy reveals he's actually\l"
	.string "the protagonist's long-lost uncle.\p"
	.string "Wait... you're all finished moving?\n"
	.string "Whatever, just don't touch the Wi-Fi.\p"
	.string "Oh, I see you have a POKéMON.\n"
	.string "Is it that one from the poopy-guy?\p"
	.string "Hm... I guess you're going to waste\n"
	.string "your life 'training' instead of\l"
	.string "watching 'Squid Game' Season 5.\p"
	.string "That's great news for me!\n"
	.string "Less talking, more streaming time!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyIdLikeAPokemon:
