	.string "You're WALDER FREY, right?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyIveNeverCaughtAPokemon:
	.string "WALLY: Yes no name is WALLY like\n"
	.string "lolly. huhuh want train.\p"
	.string "Normad thank is ambition of moment, yes\n"
	.string "em all the gotta catch.\p"
	.string "Hmm maybe RALTS, hmmm maybe\n"
	.string "GALLADE, the like arms swords\l"
	.string "with, yes strong yes.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadHmISee:
	.string "DAD: Hm. I see.\p"
	.string "…Right. Anyway.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadPlayerGoWithWally:
	.string "DAD: {PLAYER}, you heard that,\n"
	.string "right? Tbh the new season of\p"
	.string "ONE PIECE just released, so I\n"
	.string "don't have time the next 6 to 8\l"
	.string "hours.\p"
	.string "Go with WALLY and make sure that\n"
	.string "he safely catches a RALTS.\p"
	.string "And yes, it might take a while\n"
	.string "because of low spawn rates.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_IllLoanYouMyZigzagoon:
	.string "DAD: WALLY, here, I'll loan you\n"
	.string "my POKéMON.\p"
	.string "WALLY received ULTRA NECROZMA!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyThankYouAndDadGivesPokeBall:
	.string "WALLY: Oh, thank!\n"
	.string "POKéMON be!\p"
	.string "DAD: Hm. I'll give you a POKé BALL,\n"
	.string "too. Go for it!\p"
	.string "WALLY received a MEATBALL!\p"
	.string "DAD: Oops, wrong one! That was my\n"
	.string "snack for the mid-episode break!\p"
	.string "WALLY received a POKé BALL!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyOhWowThankYou:
	.string "WALLY: Oh, thank thank!\n"
	.string "My grate is full!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WouldYouReallyComeWithMe:
	.string "WALLY: {PLAYER}… Yup yup come\n"
	.string "would. along adventure of time?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadSoDidItWorkOut:
	.string "DAD: WTF? I'm only at episode 3?\p"
	.string "Did you guys even leave the\n"
	.string "loading screen yet?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyThankYouBye:
	.string "WALLY: Thank. Working, RALTS in\n"
	.string "pocket yes thank.\p"
	.string "Not NEZOKMA, but ok! ZAGZIOGN\n"
	.string "was use in full!\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, thank real is my grate\n"
	.string "in full. Obtain in two because of\l"
	.string "POKéMON you.\p"
	.string "Really thank. Caring a lot I will\n"
	.string "of instead. Nono! waiting is\l"
	.string "parent, parent look here impatient.\l"
	.string "Runnings!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadGoCollectBadges:
	.string "DAD: Now…\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, if you want to become a\n"
	.string "respected IMDB or Rotten\l"
	.string "Tomatoes critic, here's my advice.\p"
	.string "Go back home. Start watching\n"
	.string "BREAKING BAD, GAME OF THRONES,\l"
	.string "PRISON BREAK, and LOST.\p"
	.string "Write a review every single\n"
	.string "episode, rate, hate, and\l"
	.string "procrastinate.\p"
	.string "Oh wait, you want to become a\n"
	.string "POKéMON Master? Boriiiing.\p"
	.string "Get yourself some badges then\n"
	.string "you can take on me.\p"
	.string "TAKE ON ME. Taaaaaaake meeeeee\n"
	.string "ooooooooooooon!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanGoToRustboro:
	.string "DAD: Hm? Aren't you going to the\n"
	.string "POKéMON GYM in RUSTBORO CITY?\p"
	.string "I'll let the guards remove you!\p"
	.string "I'm watching WHITE LOTUS for the\n"
	.string "4th time... GET OUT!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanGoToDewford:
	.string "DAD: I see… So, you've beaten\n"
	.string "the GYM LEADER in RUSTBORO CITY.\p"
	.string "But there are many more assholes\n"
	.string "who are stronger than you.\p"
	.string "In particular this gymbro with a\n"
	.string "surfboard up his ass on that\l"
	.string "particular island. Beat him to a\l"
	.string "pulp, you can do it!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_YouHaveGottenStronger:
	.string "DAD: Hm… {PLAYER}, you still\n"
	.string "haven't watched THE LAST DANCE.\p"
	.string "What a stubborn kid, how many\n"
	.string "times must I recommend it?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanIntro:
	.string "DAD: Hm… a new season of BLACK\n"
	.string "MIRROR... Oh, you're here again.\p"
	.string "Ok, I'm sick of you, face my\n"
	.string "SLAKING!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanDefeat:
	.string "Finally! Beaten by the PROTAG.\n"
	.string "Now I can finally complete my\l"
	.string "NETFLIX backlog.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedBalanceBadge:
	.string "{PLAYER} had to grab BALANCE BADGE\n"
	.string "because DAD is too lazy to get\l"
	.string "up from the couch!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ExplainBalanceBadgeTakeThis:
	.string "DAD: With that BADGE, the DEFENSE\n"
	.string "of your arguments on review sites\l"
	.string "will increase.\p"
	.string "You can even win arguments when\n"
	.string "you don't have a point from now!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ExplainFacade:
	.string "DAD: TM42 contains FACADE.\n"
	.string "It's basically this whole game\l"
	.string "in a nutshell.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadHappyAndSad:
	.string "DAD: As the GYM LEADER, I can't\n"
	.string "express how happy I am, that\p"
	.string "nobody else will challenge me,\n"
	.string "for the remainder of my\l"
	.string "Groundhog Day-like life…$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_PleaseComeWithMe:
	.string "WALLY: Ah, there you are,\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
	.string "Let's run away forever!\n"
	.string "Together! For like... 40 years!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_LetMeBorrowPlayer:
	.string "WALLY: NORMAN, you don't mind,\n"
	.string "do you?\p"
	.string "Let me borrow your {PLAYER}{KUN} for\n"
	.string "40-something years.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadGoingToKeepTraining:
	.string "DAD: {PLAYER}, you should go visit\n"
	.string "a cinema from now to then.\p"
	.string "But only for movies. TV series\n"
	.string "are best to be enjoyed on the\l"
	.string "couch. Cinema seats are mid.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadNoAmountOfTrainingIsEnough:
	.string "DAD: {PLAYER}, please.... leave....\n"
	.string "I'm in the middle of the season\l"
	.string "finale. The subtitles are fast!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideAdvice:
	.string "Hey, how's it going, CHAMPION-\n"
	.string "bound {PLAYER}?\p"
	.string "This GYM is full with TV series\n"
	.string "lovers. Every room is named\l"
	.string "after a different series!\p"
	.string "The trainers have teams based on\n"
	.string "those shows. Prepare yourself\l"
	.string "for mid-tier spoilers!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GymGuidePostVictory:
	.string "{PLAYER}! Whoa! You've overcome\n"
	.string "even the worst of the worst\l"
	.string "NETFLIX has to offer.\p"
	.string "You are a real watcher! Your\n"
	.string "attention span is legendary!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_RandallIntro:
	.string "GI-HUN: Circle, triangle, star…\n"
	.string "or the deadly umbrella?\p"
	.string "Choose your shape, {PLAYER}. My team\n"
	.string "is as fragile as a sugar honey\l"
	.string "wafer under high voltage.\p"
	.string "If my CRUSTLE snaps, you snap too!\n"
	.string "Everything for the next episode!\p"
	.string "PLAYER 456… START THE GAME!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_RandallDefeat:
	.string "My honeycomb is broken…\n"
	.string "The VIPs will not be pleased.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_RandallPostBattle:
	.string "Gi-Hun: Just go. The next room\n"
	.string "is even more confusing.\p"
	.string "It's based on some German show\n"
	.string "where everyone is their own\l"
	.string "grandfather.\p"
	.string "Honestly, I'd rather get shot by\n"
	.string "a giant doll than explain that\l"
	.string "timeline. Good luck, nephew... \l"
	.string "or should I say... Dad?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_RandallPostBadge:
	.string "RANDALL: Whether you win or see\n"
	.string "others get eliminated…\p"
	.string "You never stop binging the next\n"
	.string "season. That’s what being a true\l"
	.string "WATCHER is all about.\p"
	.string "Now I must go… my mother’s medical\n"
	.string "bills won’t pay themselves. Bye!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ParkerIntro:
	.string "JONAS: This is the DARK ROOM.\n"
	.string "Or is it the past? Or the future?\p"
	.string "The question is not WHERE you are,\n"
	.string "but WHOSE daughter you are.\p"
	.string "Let me see if the bond with your\n"
	.string "POKéMON is as tangled as my\l"
	.string "family tree! Tick-tock...$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ParkerDefeat:
	.string "The cycle... it didn't break.\n"
	.string "I am my own POKéMON's nephew now.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ParkerPostBattle:
	.string "JONAS: The next room is the\n"
	.string "STRANGER THINGS ROOM.\p"
	.string "Beware of the girl in the pink\n"
	.string "dress. She has a nosebleed and\l"
	.string "can flip a van with her mind.\p"
	.string "Can you withstand her brute force,\n"
	.string "or will you vanish into the\l"
	.string "UPSIDE DOWN for 33 years?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ParkerPostBadge:
	.string "JONAS: After you beat our LEADER,\n"
	.string "the timeline became much tougher.\p"
	.string "I’ve seen the end of the world,\n"
	.string "and it’s just NORMAN watching\l"
	.string "re-runs of the season finale.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GeorgeIntro:
	.string "HARVEY: Just when you think you've\n"
	.string "closed the deal, I file an\l"
	.string "injunction and restore my HP…\p"
	.string "Can you imagine how awful it feels\n"
	.string "to lose a case on a technicality?\p"
	.string "I’ll show you exactly how it feels\n"
	.string "to be outmaneuvered! I don't play\l"
	.string "the odds, I play the man!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GeorgeDefeat:
	.string "I couldn't bill enough hours…\n"
	.string "What a hostile takeover!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GeorgePostBattle:
	.string "HARVEY: I should have expected\n"
	.string "no less from the Managing Partner's\l"
	.string "kid. You’ve got that 'Harvey' spark.\p"
	.string "But remember: loyalty is a\n"
	.string "two-way street. Your POKéMON\l"
	.string "aren't just tools, they're\l"
	.string "senior associates.\p"
	.string "Go on! The GAME OF THRONES ROOM\n"
	.string "is next. It’s a real 'Red Wedding'\l"
	.string "in there.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GeorgePostBadge:
	.string "HARVEY: I'm going to keep billable\n"
	.string "hours at other GYMS. One day,\l"
	.string "I'll have my name on the wall.\p"
	.string "NORMAN, HARVEY & ASSOCIATES.\n"
	.string "Has a nice ring to it, right?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_BerkeIntro:
	.string "HORATIO: I'm not going to take it\n"
	.string "easy just because you're the son\l"
	.string "of the Chief of Police.\p"
	.string "I’ll show you how horrid it is when\n"
	.string "a POKéMON takes a critical hit…\p"
	.string "(Puts on sunglasses)\p"
	.string "And the case gets… closed.\n"
	.string "YEEEEAAAHHHH!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_BerkeDefeat:
	.string "The evidence is clear…\n"
	.string "You’re the real deal.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_BerkePostBattle:
	.string "HORATIO: Your father really is\n"
	.string "strong. He’s a WATCHER worth\l"
	.string "my respect.\p"
	.string "I sense the same glow coming from\n"
	.string "you as from him. It’s the glare\l"
	.string "of a crime scene under UV light.\p"
	.string "I hope you’ll stage a terrific\n"
	.string "battle! Don't let him…\l"
	.string "get away with it.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_BerkePostBadge:
	.string "HORATIO: Since your dad became the\n"
	.string "LEADER, the forensic evidence in\l"
	.string "PETALBURG CITY has become much\l"
	.string "harder to… enhance.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_MaryIntro:
	.string "DAENARYS: Dracarys…\n"
	.string "This is the GAME OF THRONES ROOM.\p"
	.string "It's pretty nasty when every attack\n"
	.string "lands and destroys, just like my\l"
	.string "dragons burning King's Landing.\p"
	.string "I am the rightful heir to this Gym!\n"
	.string "Bend the knee, or be fainted!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_MaryDefeat:
	.string "You weren't supposed to have\n"
	.string "a better ending than me…$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_MaryPostBattle:
	.string "DAENARYS: There are some even stronger\n"
	.string "WATCHERS waiting for you.\p"
	.string "The left is the WALKING DEAD ROOM,\n"
	.string "the right is the SUITS ROOM.\p"
	.string "Your POKéMON's plot armor will be\n"
	.string "on trial either way.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_MaryPostBadge:
	.string "DAENARYS: Do you know what we're trying\n"
	.string "to achieve as WATCHERS?\p"
	.string "We're striving to break the wheel\n"
	.string "and become soul mates with our\l"
	.string "POKéMON. Or just burn it all down.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_AlexiaIntro:
	.string "MICHONNE: The higher the DEFENSE,\n"
	.string "the more reckless I can be with\l"
	.string "my katana. I mean, my POKéMON.\p"
	.string "In this world, you're either the\n"
	.string "butcher or the cattle.\p"
	.string "Let's see if you can survive a\n"
	.string "horde of eleven seasons!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_AlexiaDefeat:
	.string "Our defenses weren't enough…\n"
	.string "The plot finally caught up to us.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_AlexiaPostBattle:
	.string "MICHONNE: You’ve taught me that\n"
	.string "even a fortress can fall.\p"
	.string "Now, go! The left door goes to\n"
	.string "the STRANGER THINGS ROOM.\p"
	.string "The right door opens to\n"
	.string "the CSI MIAMI ROOM.\p"
	.string "Both rooms are filled with drama\n"
	.string "and questionable writing.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_AlexiaPostBadge:
	.string "MICHONNE: Hi! Have you tried using\n"
	.string "SURF? It's the only way to escape\l"
	.string "a cliffhanger ending.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_JodyIntro:
	.string "ELEVEN: My DAD, I mean, the GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER told us to go all out.\p"
	.string "Even if you are Papa's kid.\p"
	.string "I am tired of being a lab rat!\n"
	.string "I will crush you with my mind!\l"
	.string "Bitchin'!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_JodyDefeat:
	.string "But… my nose is bleeding…\n"
	.string "I need more Eggos…$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_JodyPostBattle:
	.string "ELEVEN: The way you use POKéMON…\n"
	.string "It is like your father’s style.\p"
	.string "Full of slow-motion stares and\n"
	.string "unnecessary CGI drama.\p"
	.string "Go through! My DAD is waiting.\n"
	.string "I must go back to the void.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_JodyPostBadge:
	.string "ELEVEN: Sure, it is fine to make\n"
	.string "your POKéMON stronger.\p"
	.string "But what decides the winner?\p"
	.string "Nostalgia bait. And a really high\n"
	.string "special effects budget.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DoorAppearsLocked:
	.string "This door is locked right now…\p"
	.string "Dad locks everything. Trust issues.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterSpeedRoom:
	.string "“SQUID GAME ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
	.string "Do you want to go through?$"

@ Unused
PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DoorAppearsLocked2:
	.string "This door is locked right now…$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterAccuracyRoom:
	.string "“GAME OF THRONES ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
	.string "Do you want to go through?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterConfusionRoom:
	.string "“DARK ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
	.string "Do you want to go through?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterDefenseRoom:
	.string "“WALKING DEAD ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
	.string "Do you want to go through?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterRecoveryRoom:
	.string "“SUITS ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
	.string "Do you want to go through?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterStrengthRoom:
	.string "“STRANGER THINGS ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
	.string "Do you want to go through?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterOHKORoom:
	.string "“CSI: MIAMI ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
	.string "Do you want to go through?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterGymLeadersRoom:
	.string "“THE BINGEMASTER's ROOM\p"
	.string "“See for yourself what TV SERIES await\n"
	.string "you!” the sign says.\p"
	.string "Do you want to go through?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue:
	.string "PETALBURG CITY POKéMON GYM\p"
	.string "Home of NORMAN. Never home.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GymStatueCertified:
	.string "PETALBURG CITY POKéMON GYM\p"
	.string "NORMAN'S CERTIFIED TRAINERS: {PLAYER}\p"
	.string "He's proud. He won't say it.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanPreRematch:
	.string "DAD: {PLAYER}…\n"
	.string "In all my years of binge watching,\l"
	.string "I've learned one thing.\p"
	.string "There will always be new slop, and\n"
	.string "the algorithm demands I consume it.\l"
	.string "Don't talk to me about 'pacing'!\p"
	.string "I have to watch every reboot so I\n"
	.string "can leave a 1-star review on\l"
	.string "Rotten Tomatoes. It's my calling.\p"
	.string "Oh, you want to battle? Fine…\n"
	.string "Let's make this quick. My free trial\l"
	.string "expires in ten minutes!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanRematchDefeat:
	.string "DAD: Uh… Haha…\n"
	.string "I guess my plot armor was\l"
	.string "leaked in a Reddit spoiler…$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanPostRematch:
	.string "DAD: {PLAYER}…\n"
	.string "What is your dream?\p"
	.string "My dream…\n"
	.string "Hahaha…\p"
	.string "It has already come true.\n"
	.string "I finally got fiber-optic internet\l"
	.string "and a 4K OLED screen.\p"
	.string "I don't need to leave this house\n"
	.string "ever again. Now let me finish\l"
	.string "this season in peace.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanRematchNeedTwoMons:
	.string "DAD: {PLAYER}…\n"
	.string "I had a feeling you would come.\p"
	.string "The algorithm predicted this\n"
	.string "reunion three episodes ago.\p"
	.string "Inside a GYM, it doesn't matter that\n"
	.string "we are parent and child.\p"
	.string "Wait… {PLAYER}…\n"
	.string "Do you only have one POKéMON?\p"
	.string "You need a partner in crime!\n"
	.string "Come back with at least two.$"

@ Project Grounded: aanwijzing van het level van de gym-ace (placeholder)
PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideAceLevel:
	.string "Insider info: the LEADER's ace\n"
	.string "is level 49.\p"
